  "as_of": "2023-11-29",
  "sentences": [
   "The bill would update references to the former Council of Australian Governments across Commonwealth legislation to reflect changes to intergovernmental councils and funding arrangements.",
   "It would rename the associated reform fund and use broader definitions of first ministers' and ministerial councils that accommodate changes in their titles.",
   "The amendments would start the day after Royal Assent, with transitional provisions recognising earlier council decisions and allowing unfinished work to continue."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "References to the former reform fund would become references to the Federation Reform Fund.",
   "Specified health legislation would replace references to advisory bodies with the Health Chief Executives Forum.",
   "The responsible minister would gain power to make rules addressing transitional matters."
  ],
  "affected": "Commonwealth, state and territory governments and intergovernmental councils are affected.",
